# tstack lint pack, C and C++. clang-tidy reads the nearest .clang-tidy above
# each file: a repo without one runs `clang-tidy --config-file=tools/lint/tstack/c-cpp/.clang-tidy`
# (or copies this file to the root); a repo with one merges Checks.
#
# Seed, from lang-c's and lang-cpp's gates: their check groups, united (the
# cppcoreguidelines and modernize checks only fire on C++), every warning an
# error. The readability subset each skill mentions is left to the repo. Each
# group's registry id is c-cpp/<group>, e.g. c-cpp/bugprone.
Checks: >-
  bugprone-*,
  cert-*,
  clang-analyzer-*,
  cppcoreguidelines-*,
  misc-*,
  modernize-*,
  performance-*,
  portability-*
WarningsAsErrors: '*'
